# Local dev only. Copy to backend/.env and fill in; `make dev` loads it and
# .env is gitignored. Deployed, these come from the Worker's bindings instead:
# the key is a secret (`wrangler secret put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`) and the rest
# are plain `[vars]` in wrangler.toml. Never commit a real key.
#
# Create a key: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Which prompt to serve when the client doesn't name one.
# PROMPT_ID=doodle
# PROMPT_VERSION=1

# Seconds before a turn is abandoned. Turns normally take 20-30s.
# REQUEST_TIMEOUT_S=180

# Route safety refusals to a fallback model. Adds a beta header to every
# request; off by default because a doodle prompt shouldn't ever need it.
# REFUSAL_FALLBACK=1
